                  "UNSPECIFIED"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-32288",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-32288"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-32288?s=golang&n=stdlib&t=golang&vr=%3C1.25.9",
              "help": {
                "text": "tar.Reader can allocate an unbounded amount of memory when reading a maliciously-crafted archive containing a large number of sparse regions encoded in the \"old GNU sparse map\" format.\n",
                "markdown": "> tar.Reader can allocate an unbounded amount of memory when reading a maliciously-crafted archive containing a large number of sparse regions encoded in the \"old GNU sparse map\" format.\n\n|                                          |\n|Package         pkg:golang/stdlib@1.19.8  |\n|Affected range  <1.25.9                   |\n|Fixed version   1.25.9                    |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
