                ],
                "security-severity": "3.1",
                "tags": [
                  "LOW"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2007-5686",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2007-5686"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2007-5686?s=debian&n=shadow&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=11&vr=%3C%3D1%3A4.8.1-1",
              "help": {
                "text": "initscripts in rPath Linux 1 sets insecure permissions for the /var/log/btmp file, which allows local users to obtain sensitive information regarding authentication attempts.  NOTE: because sshd detects the insecure permissions and does not log certain events, this also prevents sshd from logging failed authentication attempts by remote attackers.\n\n---\n- shadow <unfixed> (unimportant)\nSee #290803, on Debian LOG_UNKFAIL_ENAB in login.defs is set to no so\nunknown usernames are not recorded on login failures\n",
                "markdown": "> initscripts in rPath Linux 1 sets insecure permissions for the /var/log/btmp file, which allows local users to obtain sensitive information regarding authentication attempts.  NOTE: because sshd detects the insecure permissions and does not log certain events, this also prevents sshd from logging failed authentication attempts by remote attackers.\n\n---\n- shadow <unfixed> (unimportant)\nSee #290803, on Debian LOG_UNKFAIL_ENAB in login.defs is set to no so\nunknown usernames are not recorded on login failures\n\n|                                                                                                   |\n|Package         pkg:deb/debian/shadow@1%3A4.8.1-1?os_distro=bullseye&os_name=debian&os_version=11  |\n|Affected range  <=1:4.8.1-1                                                                        |\n|Fixed version   not fixed                                                                          |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<=1:4.8.1-1",
                "cvssV3_severity": "LOW",
                "fixed_version": "not fixed",
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/debian/shadow@1%3A4.8.1-1?os_distro=bullseye&os_name=debian&os_version=11"
                ],
