            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-2236",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-2236"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2024-2236?s=debian&n=libgcrypt20&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=11&vr=%3C%3D1.8.7-6",
              "help": {
                "text": "A timing-based side-channel flaw was found in libgcrypt's RSA implementation. This issue may allow a remote attacker to initiate a Bleichenbacher-style attack, which can lead to the decryption of RSA ciphertexts.\n\n---\n- libgcrypt20 <unfixed> (unimportant; bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1065683)\nhttps://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2268268\nhttps://lists.gnupg.org/pipermail/gcrypt-devel/2024-March/005607.html\nhttps://github.com/tomato42/marvin-toolkit/tree/master/example/libgcrypt\nhttps://people.redhat.com/~hkario/marvin/\nhttps://dev.gnupg.org/T7136\nhttps://gitlab.com/redhat-crypto/libgcrypt/libgcrypt-mirror/-/merge_requests/17\nNot in scope for libgcrypt security policy, work ongoing to add support in the protocol layer\n",
                "markdown": "> A timing-based side-channel flaw was found in libgcrypt's RSA implementation. This issue may allow a remote attacker to initiate a Bleichenbacher-style attack, which can lead to the decryption of RSA ciphertexts.\n\n---\n- libgcrypt20 <unfixed> (unimportant; bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1065683)\nhttps://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2268268\nhttps://lists.gnupg.org/pipermail/gcrypt-devel/2024-March/005607.html\nhttps://github.com/tomato42/marvin-toolkit/tree/master/example/libgcrypt\nhttps://people.redhat.com/~hkario/marvin/\nhttps://dev.gnupg.org/T7136\nhttps://gitlab.com/redhat-crypto/libgcrypt/libgcrypt-mirror/-/merge_requests/17\nNot in scope for libgcrypt security policy, work ongoing to add support in the protocol layer\n\n|                                                                                                    |\n|Package         pkg:deb/debian/libgcrypt20@1.8.7-6?os_distro=bullseye&os_name=debian&os_version=11  |\n|Affected range  <=1.8.7-6                                                                           |\n|Fixed version   not fixed                                                                           |\n"
