              "id": "CVE-2024-2379",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-2379"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2024-2379?s=debian&n=curl&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=11&vr=%3C%3D7.74.0-1.3%2Bdeb11u13",
              "help": {
                "text": "libcurl skips the certificate verification for a QUIC connection under certain conditions, when built to use wolfSSL. If told to use an unknown/bad cipher or curve, the error path accidentally skips the verification and returns OK, thus ignoring any certificate problems.\n\n---\n- curl 8.7.1-1 (unimportant)\nhttps://curl.se/docs/CVE-2024-2379.html\nIntroduced by: https://github.com/curl/curl/commit/5d044ad9480a9f556f4b6a252d7533b1ba7fe57e (curl-8_6_0)\nFixed by: https://github.com/curl/curl/commit/aedbbdf18e689a5eee8dc39600914f5eda6c409c (curl-8_7_0)\ncurl in Debian not built with wolfSSL support\n",
                "markdown": "> libcurl skips the certificate verification for a QUIC connection under certain conditions, when built to use wolfSSL. If told to use an unknown/bad cipher or curve, the error path accidentally skips the verification and returns OK, thus ignoring any certificate problems.\n\n---\n- curl 8.7.1-1 (unimportant)\nhttps://curl.se/docs/CVE-2024-2379.html\nIntroduced by: https://github.com/curl/curl/commit/5d044ad9480a9f556f4b6a252d7533b1ba7fe57e (curl-8_6_0)\nFixed by: https://github.com/curl/curl/commit/aedbbdf18e689a5eee8dc39600914f5eda6c409c (curl-8_7_0)\ncurl in Debian not built with wolfSSL support\n\n|                                                                                                          |\n|Package         pkg:deb/debian/curl@7.74.0-1.3%2Bdeb11u7?os_distro=bullseye&os_name=debian&os_version=11  |\n|Affected range  <=7.74.0-1.3+deb11u13                                                                     |\n|Fixed version   not fixed                                                                                 |\n"
              },
