            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-28757",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-28757"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2024-28757?s=debian&n=expat&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=11&vr=%3C%3D2.2.10-2%2Bdeb11u5",
              "help": {
                "text": "libexpat through 2.6.1 allows an XML Entity Expansion attack when there is isolated use of external parsers (created via XML_ExternalEntityParserCreate).\n\n---\n- expat 2.6.1-2 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1065868; unimportant)\n- libxmltok <removed>\n[bookworm] - libxmltok <ignored> (Minor issue, no runtime dependencies left)\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/pull/842\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/issues/839\nFixed by: https://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/commit/1d50b80cf31de87750103656f6eb693746854aa8\nTests: https://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/commit/072eca0b72373da103ce15f8f62d1d7b52695454\nExpat provides API to mitigate expansion attacks, ultimately under control of the app using Expat\nCf. Billion laughs attack assessment for src:expat in CVE-2013-0340.\n",
                "markdown": "> libexpat through 2.6.1 allows an XML Entity Expansion attack when there is isolated use of external parsers (created via XML_ExternalEntityParserCreate).\n\n---\n- expat 2.6.1-2 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1065868; unimportant)\n- libxmltok <removed>\n[bookworm] - libxmltok <ignored> (Minor issue, no runtime dependencies left)\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/pull/842\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/issues/839\nFixed by: https://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/commit/1d50b80cf31de87750103656f6eb693746854aa8\nTests: https://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/commit/072eca0b72373da103ce15f8f62d1d7b52695454\nExpat provides API to mitigate expansion attacks, ultimately under control of the app using Expat\nCf. Billion laughs attack assessment for src:expat in CVE-2013-0340.\n\n|                                                                                                         |\n|Package         pkg:deb/debian/expat@2.2.10-2%2Bdeb11u5?os_distro=bullseye&os_name=debian&os_version=11  |\n|Affected range  <=2.2.10-2+deb11u5                                                                       |\n|Fixed version   not fixed                                                                                |\n"
              },
