            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-9403",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2025-9403"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2025-9403?s=debian&n=jq&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=11&vr=%3C%3D1.6-2.1",
              "help": {
                "text": "A vulnerability was determined in jqlang jq up to 1.6. Impacted is the function run_jq_tests of the file jq_test.c of the component JSON Parser. Executing manipulation can lead to reachable assertion. The attack requires local access. The exploit has been publicly disclosed and may be utilized. Other versions might be affected as well.\n\n---\n- jq <unfixed> (unimportant)\nhttps://github.com/jqlang/jq/issues/3393\nAssertion failure in testsuite, negligible security impact\n",
                "markdown": "> A vulnerability was determined in jqlang jq up to 1.6. Impacted is the function run_jq_tests of the file jq_test.c of the component JSON Parser. Executing manipulation can lead to reachable assertion. The attack requires local access. The exploit has been publicly disclosed and may be utilized. Other versions might be affected as well.\n\n---\n- jq <unfixed> (unimportant)\nhttps://github.com/jqlang/jq/issues/3393\nAssertion failure in testsuite, negligible security impact\n\n|                                                                                           |\n|Package         pkg:deb/debian/jq@1.6-2.1?os_distro=bullseye&os_name=debian&os_version=11  |\n|Affected range  <=1.6-2.1                                                                  |\n|Fixed version   not fixed                                                                  |\n"
