            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-5704",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-5704"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-5704?s=debian&n=tar&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=11&vr=%3C%3D1.34%2Bdfsg-1%2Bdeb11u1",
              "help": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in tar. A remote attacker could exploit this vulnerability by crafting a malicious archive, leading to hidden file injection with fully attacker-controlled content. This bypasses pre-extraction inspection mechanisms, potentially allowing an attacker to introduce malicious files onto a system without detection.\n\n---\n- tar <unfixed> (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1132999)\nhttps://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2455360\nhttps://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/04/11/10\nhttps://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/bug-tar/2026-03/msg00007.html\nFixed by: https://cgit.git.savannah.gnu.org/cgit/tar.git/commit/?id=b8d8a61b25588caca4efaf9bdd2e3f1a49da77e3\n",
                "markdown": "> A flaw was found in tar. A remote attacker could exploit this vulnerability by crafting a malicious archive, leading to hidden file injection with fully attacker-controlled content. This bypasses pre-extraction inspection mechanisms, potentially allowing an attacker to introduce malicious files onto a system without detection.\n\n---\n- tar <unfixed> (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1132999)\nhttps://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2455360\nhttps://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/04/11/10\nhttps://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/bug-tar/2026-03/msg00007.html\nFixed by: https://cgit.git.savannah.gnu.org/cgit/tar.git/commit/?id=b8d8a61b25588caca4efaf9bdd2e3f1a49da77e3\n\n|                                                                                                  |\n|Package         pkg:deb/debian/tar@1.34%2Bdfsg-1?os_distro=bullseye&os_name=debian&os_version=11  |\n|Affected range  <=1.34+dfsg-1+deb11u1                                                             |\n|Fixed version   not fixed                                                                         |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
