            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-22365",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-22365"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2024-22365?s=debian&n=pam&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=11&vr=%3C1.4.0-9%2Bdeb11u2",
              "help": {
                "text": "linux-pam (aka Linux PAM) before 1.6.0 allows attackers to cause a denial of service (blocked login process) via mkfifo because the openat call (for protect_dir) lacks O_DIRECTORY.\n\n---\n[experimental] - pam 1.5.3-2\n- pam 1.5.3-4 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1061097)\n[bookworm] - pam 1.5.2-6+deb12u2\n[buster] - pam <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2024/01/18/3\nhttps://github.com/linux-pam/linux-pam/commit/031bb5a5d0d950253b68138b498dc93be69a64cb (v1.6.0)\n",
                "markdown": "> linux-pam (aka Linux PAM) before 1.6.0 allows attackers to cause a denial of service (blocked login process) via mkfifo because the openat call (for protect_dir) lacks O_DIRECTORY.\n\n---\n[experimental] - pam 1.5.3-2\n- pam 1.5.3-4 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1061097)\n[bookworm] - pam 1.5.2-6+deb12u2\n[buster] - pam <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2024/01/18/3\nhttps://github.com/linux-pam/linux-pam/commit/031bb5a5d0d950253b68138b498dc93be69a64cb (v1.6.0)\n\n|                                                                                                      |\n|Package         pkg:deb/debian/pam@1.4.0-9%2Bdeb11u1?os_distro=bullseye&os_name=debian&os_version=11  |\n|Affected range  <1.4.0-9+deb11u2                                                                      |\n|Fixed version   1.4.0-9+deb11u2                                                                       |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<1.4.0-9+deb11u2",
                "cvssV3_severity": "MEDIUM",
                "fixed_version": "1.4.0-9+deb11u2",
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/debian/pam@1.4.0-9%2Bdeb11u1?os_distro=bullseye&os_name=debian&os_version=11"
                ],
