            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-0395",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2025-0395"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2025-0395?s=debian&n=glibc&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=11&vr=%3C2.31-13%2Bdeb11u12",
              "help": {
                "text": "When the assert() function in the GNU C Library versions 2.13 to 2.40 fails, it does not allocate enough space for the assertion failure message string and size information, which may lead to a buffer overflow if the message string size aligns to page size.\n\n---\n- glibc 2.40-6\n[bookworm] - glibc 2.36-9+deb12u10\nhttps://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32582\nhttps://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/01/22/4\nFixed by: https://sourceware.org/git/gitweb.cgi?p=glibc.git;h=7d4b6bcae91f29d7b4daf15bab06b66cf1d2217c (2.40-branch)\nFixed by: https://sourceware.org/git/gitweb.cgi?p=glibc.git;h=7971add7ee4171fdd8dfd17e7c04c4ed77a18845 (2.36-branch)\nhttps://sourceware.org/git/?p=glibc.git;a=blob;f=advisories/GLIBC-SA-2025-0001\nhttps://sourceware.org/pipermail/libc-announce/2025/000044.html\n",
                "markdown": "> When the assert() function in the GNU C Library versions 2.13 to 2.40 fails, it does not allocate enough space for the assertion failure message string and size information, which may lead to a buffer overflow if the message string size aligns to page size.\n\n---\n- glibc 2.40-6\n[bookworm] - glibc 2.36-9+deb12u10\nhttps://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32582\nhttps://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/01/22/4\nFixed by: https://sourceware.org/git/gitweb.cgi?p=glibc.git;h=7d4b6bcae91f29d7b4daf15bab06b66cf1d2217c (2.40-branch)\nFixed by: https://sourceware.org/git/gitweb.cgi?p=glibc.git;h=7971add7ee4171fdd8dfd17e7c04c4ed77a18845 (2.36-branch)\nhttps://sourceware.org/git/?p=glibc.git;a=blob;f=advisories/GLIBC-SA-2025-0001\nhttps://sourceware.org/pipermail/libc-announce/2025/000044.html\n\n|                                                                                                        |\n|Package         pkg:deb/debian/glibc@2.31-13%2Bdeb11u6?os_distro=bullseye&os_name=debian&os_version=11  |\n|Affected range  <2.31-13+deb11u12                                                                       |\n|Fixed version   2.31-13+deb11u12                                                                        |\n"
