            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-0567",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-0567"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2024-0567?s=debian&n=gnutls28&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=11&vr=%3C3.7.1-5%2Bdeb11u5",
              "help": {
                "text": "A vulnerability was found in GnuTLS, where a cockpit (which uses gnuTLS) rejects a certificate chain with distributed trust. This issue occurs when validating a certificate chain with cockpit-certificate-ensure. This flaw allows an unauthenticated, remote client or attacker to initiate a denial of service attack.\n\n---\n- gnutls28 3.8.3-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1061045)\n[bookworm] - gnutls28 3.7.9-2+deb12u2\n[bullseye] - gnutls28 3.7.1-5+deb11u5\n[buster] - gnutls28 <not-affected> (Vulnerabity introduced in 3.7)\nhttps://gitlab.com/gnutls/gnutls/-/issues/1521\nhttps://gnutls.org/security-new.html#GNUTLS-SA-2024-01-09\nhttps://lists.gnupg.org/pipermail/gnutls-help/2024-January/004841.html\nhttps://gitlab.com/gnutls/gnutls/-/commit/9edbdaa84e38b1bfb53a7d72c1de44f8de373405 (3.8.3)\n",
                "markdown": "> A vulnerability was found in GnuTLS, where a cockpit (which uses gnuTLS) rejects a certificate chain with distributed trust. This issue occurs when validating a certificate chain with cockpit-certificate-ensure. This flaw allows an unauthenticated, remote client or attacker to initiate a denial of service attack.\n\n---\n- gnutls28 3.8.3-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1061045)\n[bookworm] - gnutls28 3.7.9-2+deb12u2\n[bullseye] - gnutls28 3.7.1-5+deb11u5\n[buster] - gnutls28 <not-affected> (Vulnerabity introduced in 3.7)\nhttps://gitlab.com/gnutls/gnutls/-/issues/1521\nhttps://gnutls.org/security-new.html#GNUTLS-SA-2024-01-09\nhttps://lists.gnupg.org/pipermail/gnutls-help/2024-January/004841.html\nhttps://gitlab.com/gnutls/gnutls/-/commit/9edbdaa84e38b1bfb53a7d72c1de44f8de373405 (3.8.3)\n\n|                                                                                                           |\n|Package         pkg:deb/debian/gnutls28@3.7.1-5%2Bdeb11u3?os_distro=bullseye&os_name=debian&os_version=11  |\n|Affected range  <3.7.1-5+deb11u5                                                                           |\n|Fixed version   3.7.1-5+deb11u5                                                                            |\n"
              },
