            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-24784",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-24784"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2024-24784?s=golang&n=stdlib&t=golang&vr=%3C1.21.8",
              "help": {
                "text": "The ParseAddressList function incorrectly handles comments (text within parentheses) within display names. Since this is a misalignment with conforming address parsers, it can result in different trust decisions being made by programs using different parsers.\n",
                "markdown": "> The ParseAddressList function incorrectly handles comments (text within parentheses) within display names. Since this is a misalignment with conforming address parsers, it can result in different trust decisions being made by programs using different parsers.\n\n|                                          |\n|Package         pkg:golang/stdlib@1.19.8  |\n|Affected range  <1.21.8                   |\n|Fixed version   1.21.8                    |\n"
