            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-68973",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2025-68973"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2025-68973?s=debian&n=gnupg2&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=11&vr=%3C2.2.27-2%2Bdeb11u3",
              "help": {
                "text": "In GnuPG before 2.4.9, armor_filter in g10/armor.c has two increments of an index variable where one is intended, leading to an out-of-bounds write for crafted input. (For ExtendedLTS, 2.2.51 and later are fixed versions.)\n\n---\n- gnupg2 2.4.8-5 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1124221)\n[trixie] - gnupg2 2.4.7-21+deb13u1\n[bookworm] - gnupg2 2.2.40-1.1+deb12u2\nhttps://gpg.fail/memcpy\nhttps://dev.gnupg.org/T7906\nhttps://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/12/28/5\nhttps://github.com/gpg/gnupg/commit/115d138ba599328005c5321c0ef9f00355838ca9 (gnupg-2.5.14)\nhttps://github.com/gpg/gnupg/commit/4ecc5122f20e10c17172ed72f4fa46c784b5fb48 (gnupg-2.4.9)\nhttps://github.com/gpg/gnupg/commit/1e929abd20fa2e4be3797a137caca63a971d5372 (gnupg-2.2.51)\n",
                "markdown": "> In GnuPG before 2.4.9, armor_filter in g10/armor.c has two increments of an index variable where one is intended, leading to an out-of-bounds write for crafted input. (For ExtendedLTS, 2.2.51 and later are fixed versions.)\n\n---\n- gnupg2 2.4.8-5 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1124221)\n[trixie] - gnupg2 2.4.7-21+deb13u1\n[bookworm] - gnupg2 2.2.40-1.1+deb12u2\nhttps://gpg.fail/memcpy\nhttps://dev.gnupg.org/T7906\nhttps://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/12/28/5\nhttps://github.com/gpg/gnupg/commit/115d138ba599328005c5321c0ef9f00355838ca9 (gnupg-2.5.14)\nhttps://github.com/gpg/gnupg/commit/4ecc5122f20e10c17172ed72f4fa46c784b5fb48 (gnupg-2.4.9)\nhttps://github.com/gpg/gnupg/commit/1e929abd20fa2e4be3797a137caca63a971d5372 (gnupg-2.2.51)\n\n|                                                                                                          |\n|Package         pkg:deb/debian/gnupg2@2.2.27-2%2Bdeb11u2?os_distro=bullseye&os_name=debian&os_version=11  |\n|Affected range  <2.2.27-2+deb11u3                                                                         |\n|Fixed version   2.2.27-2+deb11u3                                                                          |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<2.2.27-2+deb11u3",
                "cvssV3_severity": "HIGH",
                "fixed_version": "2.2.27-2+deb11u3",
                "purls": [
