              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2023-31484?s=debian&n=perl&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=11&vr=%3C5.32.1-4%2Bdeb11u4",
              "help": {
                "text": "CPAN.pm before 2.35 does not verify TLS certificates when downloading distributions over HTTPS.\n\n---\n[experimental] - perl 5.38.0~rc2-1\n- perl 5.38.2-2 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1035109)\n[bookworm] - perl 5.36.0-7+deb12u3\n[buster] - perl <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://github.com/andk/cpanpm/pull/175\nhttps://github.com/andk/cpanpm/commit/9c98370287f4e709924aee7c58ef21c85289a7f0 (2.35-TRIAL)\n",
