            {
              "id": "CVE-2023-27534",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2023-27534"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2023-27534?s=debian&n=curl&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=11&vr=%3C7.74.0-1.3%2Bdeb11u8",
              "help": {
                "text": "A path traversal vulnerability exists in curl <8.0.0 SFTP implementation causes the tilde (~) character to be wrongly replaced when used as a prefix in the first path element, in addition to its intended use as the first element to indicate a path relative to the user's home directory. Attackers can exploit this flaw to bypass filtering or execute arbitrary code by crafting a path like /~2/foo while accessing a server with a specific user.\n\n---\n- curl 7.88.1-7\n[bullseye] - curl 7.74.0-1.3+deb11u8\nhttps://curl.se/docs/CVE-2023-27534.html\nIntroduced by: https://github.com/curl/curl/commit/ba6f20a2442ab1ebfe947cff19a552f92114a29a (curl-7_18_0)\nFixed by: https://github.com/curl/curl/commit/4e2b52b5f7a3bf50a0f1494155717b02cc1df6d6 (curl-8_0_0)\nRegression fix: https://github.com/curl/curl/commit/91b53efa4b6854dc3688f55bfb329b0cafcf5325 (curl-8_1_0)\n",
                "markdown": "> A path traversal vulnerability exists in curl <8.0.0 SFTP implementation causes the tilde (~) character to be wrongly replaced when used as a prefix in the first path element, in addition to its intended use as the first element to indicate a path relative to the user's home directory. Attackers can exploit this flaw to bypass filtering or execute arbitrary code by crafting a path like /~2/foo while accessing a server with a specific user.\n\n---\n- curl 7.88.1-7\n[bullseye] - curl 7.74.0-1.3+deb11u8\nhttps://curl.se/docs/CVE-2023-27534.html\nIntroduced by: https://github.com/curl/curl/commit/ba6f20a2442ab1ebfe947cff19a552f92114a29a (curl-7_18_0)\nFixed by: https://github.com/curl/curl/commit/4e2b52b5f7a3bf50a0f1494155717b02cc1df6d6 (curl-8_0_0)\nRegression fix: https://github.com/curl/curl/commit/91b53efa4b6854dc3688f55bfb329b0cafcf5325 (curl-8_1_0)\n\n|                                                                                                          |\n|Package         pkg:deb/debian/curl@7.74.0-1.3%2Bdeb11u7?os_distro=bullseye&os_name=debian&os_version=11  |\n|Affected range  <7.74.0-1.3+deb11u8                                                                       |\n|Fixed version   7.74.0-1.3+deb11u8                                                                        |\n"
