              "help": {
                "text": "An issue was discovered in libexpat before 2.6.3. nextScaffoldPart in xmlparse.c can have an integer overflow for m_groupSize on 32-bit platforms (where UINT_MAX equals SIZE_MAX).\n\n---\n- expat 2.6.2-2 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1080152)\n- libxmltok <removed>\n[bookworm] - libxmltok <ignored> (Minor issue, no runtime dependencies left)\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/pull/892\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/issues/889\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/commit/29ef43a0bab633b41e71dd6d900fff5f6b3ad5e4 (R_2_6_3)\n",
                "markdown": "> An issue was discovered in libexpat before 2.6.3. nextScaffoldPart in xmlparse.c can have an integer overflow for m_groupSize on 32-bit platforms (where UINT_MAX equals SIZE_MAX).\n\n---\n- expat 2.6.2-2 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1080152)\n- libxmltok <removed>\n[bookworm] - libxmltok <ignored> (Minor issue, no runtime dependencies left)\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/pull/892\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/issues/889\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/commit/29ef43a0bab633b41e71dd6d900fff5f6b3ad5e4 (R_2_6_3)\n\n|                                                                                                         |\n|Package         pkg:deb/debian/expat@2.2.10-2%2Bdeb11u5?os_distro=bullseye&os_name=debian&os_version=11  |\n|Affected range  <2.2.10-2+deb11u6                                                                        |\n|Fixed version   2.2.10-2+deb11u6                                                                         |\n"
